 12049cac859375602a5e3f8dbd9e528d352d445fafc2861aaf615036d9a5c9a23dfdbb388f68946af66b757d2e123254eff120b4f1caf99142bad16c71c0a1b6  0228-media-iris-support-decode-order-output-on-HFI-gen2.patch
 dd7114f3037e900c8b437031976551ebb3472be644c74862498e8e65c57f3248177ce4cb3e64617db9229a61f1a2d174e9ff61c4316c66a19678e8d231b2b453  0229-media-iris-support-decoder-display-delay-controls-on.patch
+7926622e16ec92abb445fac1fb0290dd6123ce72f2ad3dd2d7c800f1cebd70c77631fd04c5845baf80b6bc1ed0170519fe1ccf7891a91d0e01735ff0a6acde4a  0230-power-supply-qcom_pm8150b-detect-the-charger-when-US.patch
